      "skillOrderNotes": {
        "interleave": "Two-source rules (docs/research/2026-10-cleric-pack.md §3.2: daevaguides, mmo-codex, skycoach, Metabot's leveling notes): attack skills before heals while leveling; Chain of Torment and Condemnation are raised as fast as their gates allow; Earth's Grace (21) goes to 10 the level it is learned (flat gate, so it is listed after the core eight, where the flat gate applies). Whether Earth's Retribution and Judgment Thunder (daevaguides) or Condemnation's pair (mmo-codex) take the first points is not agreed; before Lv 8 Condemnation doesn't exist, so the two orders only differ from Lv 8 to about 19, and the order between those rules is inferred.",
        "budget": "Core eight to Lv 10 = 8 × 21 = 168 points; Earth's Grace to 10 = 21 (189); Debilitating Mark to 7 = 9 (198), Radiant Recovery to 5 = 5 (203). LEVEL_POINTS[45] = 203 (Metabot; aion2turkiye agrees) plus Wisdom Stones. Bolt to 10 by 38 (daevaguides, aion2turkiye) needs quest and Sealed Dungeon points on top (claim C92)."
      },
